# LaTeX build artifacts — never commit these: stale .aux files generated by a
# different TeX distribution break fresh compiles (e.g. on Overleaf-like sites).
# Exception: prebuilt bibliography/glossary/index outputs ARE committed (below),
# because latex.sharif.edu cannot run bibtex8/xindy with the Persian modules —
# with these files present, a xelatex-only compile still renders everything.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.loa
*.lol
*.bbl
*.blg
*.blo
*.bls
*.glo
*.gls
*.glg
*.acn
*.acr
*.alg
*.idx
*.ind
*.ilg
*.ist
*.xdy.log
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.xdv
*.mw
main.pdf
tex/*.aux
# committed prebuilt outputs (see note above)
!main.bbl
!main.bls
!main.gls
!main.acr
!main.ind
